WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.936
Divide hundreds, then tens, then ones. Check every answer by multiplication.

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:14.594
Calculate 455 divided by 5. The answer is 91. 5 times 91 equals 455.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:21.563
A club on a football field shares 450 pencils equally among 6 teams. How many per

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:23.855
team? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:31.763
A club on a football field shares 450 pencils equally among 6 teams. How many per

00:00:31.763 --> 00:00:36.177
team? The answer is 75. 6 times 75 equals 450.
